<title>FINLAND: Finnair March load factor up at 72.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Finnair March load factor up at 72.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish national airline Finnair Oy said in a statement on Friday its passenger load factor rose 0.7 percentage points year-on-year in March to 72.6 percent.  </p>
<p>Finnair gave the following statistics:</p>
<p>					March 1997   Feb 1997  Yr/yr(pct)</p>
<p> Passengers (thousand)	     576	   474	  +2.2</p>
<p> RPK (million)		     1,048	   866	  +2.7</p>
<p> RTK (million)			 122	   100	  +8.9</p>
<p> Cargo and mail (thousand kg)  6,771	 5,568	 +23.7</p>
<p> Passenger load factor (pct)    72.6	  67.7	  +0.7 pts</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>March 1997 totals broken down by flight type:</p>
<p>			Passengers   RPK	 RTK	    Cargo</p>
<p>			thousand   million    million     thousand kg</p>
<p> International	 308	 783	  98	    6,117</p>
<p> Domestic		227	 111	  10		502</p>
<p> Charter		  42	 155	  15		152</p>
<p>Load factor (percent) by flight type:</p>
<p>				 March 1997  Feb 1997  Yr/yr(pct pts)</p>
<p> International		  73.4	 66.5	  +2.1</p>
<p> Domestic			 59.0	 54.3	  -3.3</p>
<p>Finnair's financial year runs from April 1 to March 31. @</p>
<p>RPK - revenue passenger km (revenue passengers carried multiplied by km flown)</p>
<p>RTK - revenue tonne km (tonnage of revenue load carried -- passengers, cargo and mail -- multiplied by km flown.</p>
<p>Passenger load factor - RPK as a percentage of available seat km.</p>
<p>Finnair does not give a cargo load factor. --Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
